{
  "@context": [
    "context.jsonld",
    {
      "@base": "../"
    }
  ],
  "id": "cases/catalogue",
  "type": "spo:InformationContentEntity",
  "title": {
    "zh": "算例语料目录",
    "en": "The scenario corpus"
  },
  "note": {
    "zh": "每一份算例是一份 fyo:ScenarioSpecification（spo:ComputationPlan）：它规定哪一项能力（prescribes_code）、以什么参数设置（has_parameter_setting，值为 JSON 字面量）、关于哪台机器 / 哪一炮（about_discharge）、调用方还须绑定哪些输入端口（has_port_binding，未绑定即为开放端口）以及本仓不具备的能力（caveat）。算例只带输入，不带结果：它是一次运行的单一输入结构，运行的记录是另一份文档（spo:ComputationRecord）。★目录的成员顺序就是列出顺序；每个成员的 concretized_as 指向承载它的文件。★2026-09-02：由页面会话文档形态（AppSession/1，私有词表）改写而来（词汇归 fyo / spo，FYO-ADR-07）；页面自 2026-09-01 起不读本语料，读者是 `fylite cases` 与 `fylite.scenario.cases`。",
    "en": "Each case is one fyo:ScenarioSpecification (an spo:ComputationPlan): which capability it prescribes (prescribes_code), with which parameter settings (has_parameter_setting, values as JSON literals), which machine / pulse it is about (about_discharge), which input ports the caller still has to bind (has_port_binding; an unbound binding is an OPEN port) and which capabilities this repository lacks (caveat). A case carries inputs and never a result: it is the single input structure of a run, whose record is a separate document (spo:ComputationRecord). ★The member order is the listing order; each member's concretized_as names the file that carries it. ★2026-09-02: rewritten from the page session-document form (AppSession/1, private vocabulary) (vocabulary fyo / spo only, FYO-ADR-07); the pages have not read this corpus since 2026-09-01 — its readers are `fylite cases` and `fylite.scenario.cases`."
  },
  "recorded": "2026-09-02",
